{"name": "fact-repair-512-9000", "seconds": 27.360656499999095, "error": null, "calls": [{"seconds": 12.182072600000538, "actual_input_tokens": 3182, "actual_output_tokens": 227, "done_reason": "stop", "done": true}], "status": "answered", "task_complete": null, "answer": "## 回答\n原文依据：To explore model scalability, we use the ILSVRC-2012 ImageNet dataset with 1k classes and 1.3M images (we refer to it as ImageNet in what follows), its superset ImageNet-21k with 21k classes and 14M images (Deng et al., 2009), and JFT (Sun et al., 2017) with 18k classes and 303M high-resolution images. [参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\nImageNet 数据集包含 1000 个类别和 130 万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nImageNet-21k 数据集包含 21000 个类别和 1400 万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nJFT 数据集包含 18000 个类别和 30300 万张高分辨率图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\n## 参考来源\n- [参考文档4] Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）", "warnings": []}
{"name": "fact-repair-1024-9000", "seconds": 23.83959959999993, "error": null, "calls": [{"seconds": 7.308598199999324, "actual_input_tokens": 3182, "actual_output_tokens": 214, "done_reason": "stop", "done": true}], "status": "answered", "task_complete": null, "answer": "## 回答\n原文依据：To explore model scalability, we use the ILSVRC-2012 ImageNet dataset with 1k classes and 1.3M images (we refer to it as ImageNet in what follows), its superset ImageNet-21k with 21k classes and 14M images (Deng et al., 2009), and JFT (Sun et al., 2017) with 18k classes and 303M high-resolution images. [参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\nImageNet数据集包含1000个类别和130万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nImageNet-21k数据集包含21000个类别和1400万张图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\nJFT数据集包含18000个类别和30.3亿张高分辨率图像。[参考文档4：Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）]\n\n## 参考来源\n- [参考文档4] Windows验收\\_ViT.pdf；第4页（物理页码）", "warnings": []}
